# Malie City and Malie Garden: a city of paper lanterns and a garden of still water, calm and a little formal. A harp
# running a pentatonic tune in D over a warm pad and a slow bass, a bamboo flute holding long notes above it from the second
# part, a bell for each lantern on every other bar and a marimba touching the chord once a bar; no drums. At night a celesta,
# an ocarina and a vibraphone.
# Original composition for this game, in the modern sound.
title Malie City
tempo 76
